#
# System defaults for run-state colours, for light and dark themes.
# Each reaches 4.5:1 against its theme's background; a fill too pale for
# a light theme (created, submitted) is drawn with an outline at half its
# brightness instead, which must reach 3:1.  WxState.C holds the same
# values as a fallback.  Checked by tests/look/contrast.py.
#
